kyoushitsu no sumikko de

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:25.800
kuchizusanda okiniiri no uta

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:31.730
naze ka kyou wa kanashii kimochi ga

00:22:32.770 --> 00:22:35.960
afureteshimatta yo

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:43.000
okaeri, watashi  machi wa yasashiku

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:46.790
mukaetekureru no

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:50.980
nee anata ni aitai na

00:22:52.540 --> 00:22:58.100
umaku waraetenai toki wa sotto oshiete hoshii

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:03.020
hikikaesenakunaru mae ni

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:06.970
futari kokoroniji wo kakete

