00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:37.030
I was finally able to come back to this town.

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:39.680
I'm glad things have remained the same.

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:42.250
Kirino-chan and Onii-chan, too.

00:23:43.330 --> 00:23:47.050
But now, I'm suddenly the center of attention at school.

00:23:47.050 --> 00:23:49.920
A photo in a magazine? An interview?

00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:52.480
You're asking me about my first love...?

00:23:52.820 --> 00:24:02.830
<i>The First Love</i>

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:55.240
Next time, "The First Love."

00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:59.360
Who will you give your Gift?
